d; 2. friendly.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "kftopaBoga": [{"id": "kftopaBoga", "headword": "कृतोपभोग", "headword_slp1": "kftopaBoga", "fold": "kftopaBoga", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "कृत-उपभोग a. used, enjoyed.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "kftakarman": [{"id": "kftakarman", "headword": "कृतकर्मन्", "headword_slp1": "kftakarman", "fold": "kftakarman", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "कृत-कर्मन् (I) a. 1. one who has done his work, R.ix.3; 2. skilful, clever.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "कृत-कर्मन् (II) m. 1. the supreme spirit; 2. a sannyāsin.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["कृतकर्म्मन्"], "synonyms_slp1": ["kftakarmman"]}], "kftakama": [{"id": "kftakAma", "headword": "कृतकाम", "headword_slp1": "kftakAma", "fold": "kftakama", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "कृत-काम a. one whose desire is attained.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "kftakala": [{"id": "kftakAla", "headword": "कृतकाल", "headword_slp1": "kftakAla", "fold": "kftakala", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "कृत-काल (I) a. fixed or settled as to time.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "कृत-काल (II) m. appointed time, Yaj.ii.184.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["कृतकालः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["kftakAlaH"]}], "kftakftya": [{"id": "kftakftya", "headword": "कृतकृत्य", "headword_slp1": "kftakftya", "fold": "kftakftya", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "कृत-कृत्य a. 1. who has accomplished or attained his object, Bg.xv.20; 2. satisfied, contented, Sant.S.iii.19.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["कृतकृत्यः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["kftakftyaH"]}], "kftakraya": [{"id": "kftakraya", "headword": "कृतक्रय", "headword_slp1": "kftakraya", "fold": "kftakraya", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "कृत-क्रय m. a purchaser.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["कृतक्रयः"], "sy